{"server":"tw","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_st02","groupId":"act42side","stageId":"act42side_st02","title":"啟聖","storyCode":"MT-ST-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"ae76d17aef9b8e0584022e0a420835755fdc51c09671ea37d078f0e5a34a0693","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"降生儀式順利舉行，無數人見證了一隻木攀獸誕下長有光環的幼獸。牧首向眾人宣布，此後拉特蘭將為所有人賦予光環。費德里科與阿爾圖羅回到現實，發現拉特蘭全城正被“夢境”所籠罩。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，執行者先生，所以你完全沒想過將阿爾圖羅小姐帶回蘭登修道院？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有表達過這樣的意圖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就帶她回蘭登修道院了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還需要藉助阿爾圖羅確認一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，不能這樣欺負一位修女哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凱萊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，不就是在告解車前面對你開了兩句玩笑，有需要跑那麼快嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼玩笑？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好吧……總之，我知道這個通緝犯的事情很棘手，所以特地帶人過來支援你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還特地放棄去觀摩降生儀式的機會，感動吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並未向公證所申請任何形式的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我知道，你甚至沒怎麼和其他執行者一起行動過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你以為我想插手啊？這是教皇廳七個分廳聯合發布的特別行動指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，我接到通訊的時候嚇了一跳……害我以為阿爾圖羅蠱惑你一起叛國了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有這種傾向，她也不具備這個能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"評估完畢，教皇廳的風險預期可以排除。執行者里凱萊，請現在帶人返回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒理解錯的話，你拒絕了特別行動指令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你沒有拒絕的權利哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我接到的任務是——降生儀式開始前，監督費德里科將阿爾圖羅緝拿歸案，如果這兩人有任何異動，便將他們一同帶回！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還太早，執行者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅小姐，你是在對我說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回來之後，我一直待在修道院裡，好不容易出來一趟，還不想那麼早回去呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有十多年沒看過聖城一點點沉入夜色了……這裡的視野很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是想負隅頑抗嗎……真是的，又要加班了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"席德佳修女，請躲到我們身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，接下來交給你指揮吧。長久以來，重大通緝犯阿爾圖羅都是你在負責，你最熟悉她的種種手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來拉特蘭一直在注視著你呢，費迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舉起你的銃吧，反正你不是第一次這麼做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿爾圖羅站在天台的邊緣，費德里科還有許多問題要問她，但他注意到對方的手指已經撫上了琴弦。\n越過她，費德里科看到了高不見頂的育嬰聖堂，和絡繹不絕擁向其中的人群。\n里凱萊和其他同僚站在自己身後，費德里科聽見了武器上膛的聲音。\n場面變得微妙起來，好像作為執行者的自己突然需要去證明些什麼。\n幾乎沒有思考的時間，費德里科舉起了守護銃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，你對自己的越獄行為供認不諱，我代表公證所，正式重啟對你的危險評估與抓捕程序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應履行拉特蘭公民之義務，配合我們解除拉特蘭之風險。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒有任何徵兆，費德里科的守護銃噴吐出火舌。\n同一個瞬間，大提琴的聲音如流水般傾瀉，與育嬰聖堂方向傳來的讚歌聲融為一體，淹沒了天台上的異響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你幹什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是精準射擊你們身旁的建築物，並沒有瞄準你們本人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，好痛……*拉特蘭俚語*，我的頭被石頭打到了……是不是流血了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你最好清楚自己在做的事情代表著什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是流血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情結束後，我會提交詳細的任務報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……包括對你頭部受傷細節的解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真果斷啊，執行者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，你要怎麼處理這些暈過去的人呢……你在搜什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凱萊的身上有告解車的年卡，給那些載具設定好目的地後，它們可以送這些人到醫院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，向我同步你的發現，配合我解除拉特蘭之風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是猜測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一路追過來，又選擇將自己的同僚送離這裡，說明你已經有了和我相同的猜測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間快到了，費迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許這座城市很快便會告訴我們，它到底發生了什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"//换新的"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫蘭塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還從來沒在拉特蘭見過這麼多異族人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次萬國峰會的時候，其他國家的來賓加起來都沒有住滿一間飯店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教皇廳幾乎所有的樞機都到場了……人真多啊，比大教堂的氣氛更讓人不自在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個位置已經夠偏了，莫斯提馬。我們就像兩個在輪盤賭場外等著擦地板的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所謂的降生儀式，無非就是安多恩待會把剛學會說話的薩科塔小孩抱出來，再由那邊的牧首象徵性地為他“擦亮光環”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是一個噱頭罷了，不如回家看《獨臂電鋸俠2》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就當為了看看保育員安多恩是怎麼工作的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你該跟他說的話不都已經說過了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道為什麼，從剛才開始，總感覺心臟有點不舒服……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，莫斯提馬，你感受到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲亞梅塔轉頭望去，好友的表情變得前所未有地嚴肅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像在為什麼事情感到緊張……不，是焦慮，是恐懼，是一些無緣無故的興奮，又有些期待……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很難形容，心跳好像都不是自己的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是共感？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個墮天使、一個黎博利，我們都沒有這種能力。不對，不只我們……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉菲亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲亞梅塔的目光掃過周圍，她終於確定那心跳不是幻覺。\n她此刻感受到的種種情緒同樣正寫在周圍人的臉上，在場的每一人都在隨那不屬於自己的心跳聲而悸動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……看頭頂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些安撫鈴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲亞梅塔順著好友的視線看過去。\n降生儀式開始後，所有的門窗都已關閉，沒有一絲風吹進來。\n但無論是在她們身處的啟聖大廳，還是在通往育嬰室的走廊，安撫鈴明明在有規律地晃動著，卻並未發出應有的清脆聲響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一種媒介……像是萊塔尼亞人愛擺弄的那些音樂裝置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我猜得沒錯，我們正在感受的，是那位正在分娩的母親的心跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一模一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我妻子生產的時候，我就在產房外等著，處境跟現在一模一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能清晰感受到她當時承受著多強烈的疼痛，但她不願意放棄，她的情緒牽動著我，我們一起呼喚著之前為孩子取好的名字……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“貝利、貝利……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位母親，剛剛是暈過去了嗎？她太虛弱了，分娩的痛苦已經超出她現在能承受的極限——情、情況非常不樂觀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的心臟都快要跳出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，她還不想放棄……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主啊，主，潔白無瑕的聖城，請護佑我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀&庫蘭塔&菲林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請護佑我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請護佑我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這確實算是一種……“共感”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"narration","text":"整個聖堂的安撫鈴激烈地搖晃著，心跳聲毫無規律，那變幻的情緒緊緊牽動著所有人的神經。\n無人知道那位母親是誰、她叫什麼名字、她多大年紀、她來自何處……但所有人都知曉她在經歷什麼，無一人挪動腳步。\n脆弱的新生還未戰勝死亡，從蒙昧中破殼似乎遙遙無期。育嬰聖堂內，數千人正在共同經歷一場分娩——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉特蘭本不該存在如此清晰的共感。\n良久，良久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那心跳聲漸漸弱了下來，直至歸於平靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"連上這根遙感線，啟動計時器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最後一顆炸彈……搞定！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，這個心跳聲……真的很難忍住不去感同身受啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸虧我有企鵝物流最好用的頭腦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是能一邊左手玩《唱片大亨》，一邊右手玩光銃射酒瓶遊戲，同時贏了老闆和德克薩斯的超人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼長的時間，不是白練的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒數計時，兩分鐘！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要炸毀這段走廊，通向那間育嬰室的路就全斷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望老姐的情報沒有錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"育嬰聖堂從移動修道院裡找來了一位薩卡茲孕婦，還特地辦了個所謂的儀式，讓她在萬國峰會上生下薩卡茲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道這群人的目的是什麼，但只要不讓她出現在大家面前，就能——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"借過一下好嗎，別擋在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個母親馬上就要分娩了，我想靠近點，為她祈禱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我現在就……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲……孕婦……那不就是你嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"添頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1807_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你不是應該正在分娩——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆樂，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的姐姐曾經帶著你來我家裡玩，我們見過面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，菲亞梅塔的爺爺，您好——啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃騎","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖堂巡邏守衛們 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃騎","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特里奇昂閣下，剩下的人正在搜索炸彈，並逐一排除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攔住這個薩科塔，她身上還有更多爆炸物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖堂巡邏守衛 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請放心。遠程單位已就位，如果嫌犯逃跑，我們會當場狙殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿摩斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1783_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特里奇昂閣下……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安樞機，你來遲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將嫌犯帶回第七廳吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，如果降生儀式不是為這個薩卡茲準備的，那……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知不覺間，那響遍整個聖堂的心跳聲已經安靜了下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"某道走廊的深處，一扇門打開了。能天使循聲望去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"保育員懷抱著小小的襁褓，站在門前洞開的光亮裡。他的雙手和袍袖滿是血污，但襁褓是乾淨的。\n他眉眼低垂，緩步走向啟聖大廳，走向焦急等待的牧首，人群自動為他讓出一條路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i08"},{"type":"narration","text":"牧首接過保育員遞過來的新生兒。她目不能視，沒能看見對方眉眼間深鎖的悲憫。\n牧首輕輕揭開了襁褓，那幼小的生命露出了真容——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一隻幼獸。\n他靠在牧首的肩頭，那包裹著稚嫩腿爪的黏膜還未完全褪去，濕漉漉皺巴巴的毛髮沒有舒展的跡象。\n他緊閉著眼睛，呼吸幾不可聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如各位所見，育嬰聖堂建成後，接生的第一個生命，是一隻木攀獸的幼獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"牠輕若無物，可又有著令人敬畏的重量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來到拉特蘭之前，我在一座廢棄的移動修道院偶然發現了牠的母親——骨瘦如柴，羽毛脫落，我幾乎沒能認出那是一隻木攀獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"獵人的長槍貫穿了母獸的腰腹，只是毫釐之差，沒有傷及其中的胎兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道這孩子的母親是如何躲開人群藏匿了許久，怎麼維生，又是怎樣強忍著重傷和飢餓保持清醒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直至今日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感謝這位堅強的母親，也感謝各位薩科塔與黎博利同胞，以及遠來的異族客人們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個孩子在我們所有人的祈願中降生，牠是你們共同創造的奇蹟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但為何……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為何牠遲遲不願睜開眼睛？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牧首，這孩子的呼吸已經越來越微弱……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想了很多辦法，牠的母親，也已經拼盡全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是母體受傷太重，這孩子在孕育期間沒有汲取到足夠的營養，所以……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，或許我們所有人都忽略了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才的分娩過程漫長而煎熬，可是透過安撫鈴，從始至終，我們只共感到一個心跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這孩子太過脆弱，甚至無法表達自己求生的渴望，那本應是生命最原始的呼喊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"安多恩低垂著眉眼，不再言語。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬，你有想到降生儀式是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照往常的流程，現在早就該圍著嗷嗷大哭的孩子分蛋糕了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，這也太令人難過了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那兩人的意思是，那個媽媽那麼努力，最後只生下一個死胎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這*敘拉古粗口*的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們、我們還能做些什麼嗎？就像剛剛幾千人一起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢想，如果當時守在產房外的自己，經過幾小時漫長的等待後，沒有感應到小貝利的心跳……我和我的妻子該怎麼辦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，我不敢再繼續想了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可憐的孩子，如果你能聽見我的呼喚……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i09_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群中傳來了極低的啜泣聲。\n繼而，越來越多的人再也無法控制住自己的情緒，哭聲連綴成一片，在空曠的聖堂中迴盪……為一個可憐的母親，為一個夭折的嬰兒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i09"},{"type":"narration","text":"又一聲哭聲響起。\n那聲音並不悲傷，它稚嫩而嘹亮。\n彷彿是感應到了人們的情緒，木攀獸幼獸睜開了眼睛，發出生命中第一聲吶喊。與此同時，牠舒展著肢體，毛髮奇蹟般變得豐盈。\n牧首忍不住抱緊了懷中的生命，喜極而泣。一滴淚從她眼罩後空洞的眼眶中滑落，落在幼獸的頭頂，折射出太陽的光亮。\n幼獸的哭聲未停，那點光亮像是被哭聲催動，一點點從虛空中褪去束縛，變得圓滿——\n光環。\n薩科塔的印記，律法的象徵，真理的具象，此刻，它點亮了這個陌生的族類——\n熠熠生輝，彷彿奇蹟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"主再一次回應了我們的期待，祂選擇為這個孩子賜福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是千年難遇的聖蹟。災異當前，它的出現，是律法給予我們的啟示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們每一人都見證了它，我們每一人都參與了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此後，以這座聖城為始，以這座聖城為終，我們生而平等，我們生而為一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——作為薩科塔。"},{"type":"narration","text":"牧首的懷中，那年幼的生命此刻正在舔拭牧首的手臂，牠已經徹底甦醒。\n安撫鈴再一次無風自動，強健的心跳聲襲捲了整座育嬰聖堂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……拉特蘭向一隻木攀獸的幼獸分享了光環？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕《聖徒行記》裡最誇張的奇觀，也很難和眼前的景象相提並論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費迪，你說這是一種神聖的賜福，還是一種可怕的災異？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更在意的是，它是否真實可信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是從什麼時候開始懷疑眼前的一切的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有太多細節，阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行蹤詭異的告解車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無邊的麥田。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遭到嚴格管控的銃械與炸藥製造，被全面關閉的銃械工坊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然間變更了職能的蘭登修道院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行政體系大變的教皇廳，突然強力干涉我調查的同僚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凱萊對我的行動並不知情，卻能在最關鍵的時刻帶隊前來，幫助我確認了自己的判斷，否則我仍會對你動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種種異象的終點，便是眼前彷彿橫空出世的育嬰聖堂，和這場萬眾期待的降生儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你在移動修道院追查的失蹤的母親，其實是那隻懷孕的木攀獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的琴聲與牠的心聲偶然交錯，隨後我一路追來這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起上述種種，真正影響我判斷的是——對這一切渾然不覺的拉特蘭人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活的各個方面明明都發生了天翻地覆的變化，但這個國家、這座城市仍在有序地運行著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當六百萬拉特蘭人都在以如常的姿態生活，我們很難說服自己，唯有我們自己在保持清醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費迪，對你這樣的死腦筋來說，這種自我懷疑真是難得的經歷啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，此時此刻，你確定了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數學、物理、地理、考古學、天文學……從現有科學的任何角度以及神學和哲學的任何理論，都無從解釋……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"存在一種力量，能讓一座六百萬人口的城市陷入群體性的幻覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但眼前的情形，已與拉特蘭的秩序、律法的根基徹底背道而馳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再無疑惑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真巧啊，我也是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g8_catastrophicsquare"},{"type":"narration","text":"安撫鈴的鈴聲在城市上空迴盪，提琴聲像是探入城市的手，撥開了一絲縫隙。下一個瞬間，這兩種聲音同時被掐斷——\n“寂靜”——費德里科心想。\n廣場前來來往往的人流從未存在，哪怕他曾經站在大教堂最高的屋頂上眺望整座城市，拉特蘭也從未如此刻這般寂靜。\n費德里科與阿爾圖羅不確定自己是否有那麼一瞬間眨了眼，因為極其詭異的景象正在他們眼前展開——\n那座格格不入的聖堂依然矗立在城市之中，但和剛才所見不同的是，夢幻般的色彩正在它的表面流淌。\n它太高了，高得聳入雲端，以至於將色彩都傾瀉在了周圍那些潔白的建築上。\n拉特蘭的大街小巷，被聖堂的倒影覆蓋的地方，像是開了一扇又一扇門，或者一扇又一扇窗，形貌詭異的生物正從其中分離出來……\n完全無法形容眼前這詭異的景象，但費德里科與阿爾圖羅無比確信，這是真實的拉特蘭。\n下一秒，同一個詞衝出了他們的齒間——\n“災異”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
